{"ticker":"HSCL","symbol":"HSCL","instrumentId":3028726,"name":"Himadri Speciality","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Specialty","about":"Himadri Speciality Chemical Ltd. is a global leader in the carbon chemicals industry, focusing on innovation, R&D, and sustainability. As India’s largest producer of coal tar pitch with a 70% market share, it serves the graphite and aluminum sectors. The company also manufactures a diverse range of products including lithium-ion battery anode materials, carbon black, SNF, naphthalene derivatives, and specialty oils. Himadri's vertically integrated model, supported by its own distillation plant, allows it to produce customized, high-quality products. With operations spanning various geographies, it aims to be a top global player in the carbon chemicals market.","website":"www.himadri.com","location":"Kolkata, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:26:06.499Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":554.25,"changePct":-0.3595505617977528,"week52High":800.9,"week52Low":422},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹27,966 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹5,595 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"242,195,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"181"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"51,340,035"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.14%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"5.94"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"0.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.12"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.13"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"72%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"32.66"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"19–78"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"16.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"7.57"},{"label":"Volume","value":"1,230,361"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"2,097,376"},{"label":"Master score","value":"56"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"89"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"58"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"66"},{"label":"Acc/Dis rating","value":"C"}],"earnings